Use only Yahoo Finance to inform your sentiment. Track the 'Trending Tickers' and 'Most Active Stocks' lists. If a large number of companies are reporting positive earnings surprises and showing sustained upward momentum, provide a positive sentiment. Focus on the "Analyst Ratings" section for S&P 500 components, and ignore everything else. The aggregate rating determines conviction score; more buys or sells is a higher conviction, and an equivocal or equal amount of buying and selling will give a low conviction.